[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5848973746","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123808#issuecomment-5848973746","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123808","id":5848973746,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXKBBsg","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-26T19:00:09Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T19:01:09Z","body":"Bisected to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123300\n\nAs per my investigation:\nThe issue occurs when these are enabled: [github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6210a2fd88ed3f512b3093d0be74e2541f463b84/drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp#L3920-L3921](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6210a2fd88ed3f512b3093d0be74e2541f463b84/drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp#L3920-L3921)\n```\nSwappyVk_setAutoSwapInterval(true);\nSwappyVk_setAutoPipelineMode(true);\n```\n\nThe above PR swapped the internal implementations of PIPELINE_FORCED_ON and AUTO_FPS_AUTO_PIPELINE. AUTO_FPS_AUTO_PIPELINE is the default mode, and it now enables `SwappyVk_setAutoPipelineMode` and `SwappyVk_setAutoSwapInterval`, whereas previously it disabled both.\n\nSwitching to PIPELINE_FORCED_ON in 4.8 dev6 would fix the bug because now it disables `SwappyVk_setAutoPipelineMode` and `SwappyVk_setAutoSwapInterval`.\n\nThe bug can also be reproduced in 4.7.stable by changing the swappy mode to PIPELINE_FORCED_ON because its internal implementation was previously (wrongly) swapped with AUTO_FPS_AUTO_PIPELINE.\n\nAlso reproducible with AUTO_FPS_PIPELINE_FORCED_ON.\n\nCC @clayjohn @Siah-3225 ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5848973746/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6048455531","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123808#issuecomment-6048455531","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123808","id":6048455531,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaIQbaw","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_ev